(2280499, 314829, 888, '<td valign="top">beautiful colours, very artifical looking sky, seems to be a trend in this challenge, you''re the third I''ve made that comment to!!  Did you Neat Image the sky?   Maybe the limitations of 2002 cameras have caused problems.<br/> <br/>The lovely colours and nice composition rescue it for me though.  7 from me</td>', 'beautiful colours, very artifical looking sky, seems to be a trend in this challenge, you''re the third I''ve made that comment to!!  Did you Neat Image the sky?   Maybe the limitations of 2002 cameras have caused problems. The lovely colours and nice composition rescue it for me though.  7 from me', '2006-04-02 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
