(2296077, 314448, 40370, '<td valign="top">I could wake up to that. Beautiful peach tones, and the lightest blue/gray, they look wonderful together in the sky and on the water.</td>', 'I could wake up to that. Beautiful peach tones, and the lightest blue/gray, they look wonderful together in the sky and on the water.', '2006-04-07 20:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
