(2296874, 314436, 56855, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, a bit noisy, but it adds to the effect.  The colors are beautiful and the linear banding of forms is really pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'This is a great shot, a bit noisy, but it adds to the effect.  The colors are beautiful and the linear banding of forms is really pleasing to the eye.', '2006-04-08 02:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
