(2297126, 314648, 46663, '<td valign="top">tranquil - glass effect of water was captured well.</td>', 'tranquil - glass effect of water was captured well.', '2006-04-08 06:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297129, 314765, 46663, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot - feels cold yet at the same time invigorating.</td>', 'beautiful shot - feels cold yet at the same time invigorating.', '2006-04-08 06:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297281, 314855, 34192, '<td valign="top">The tones, the expression, the timelessness all add up to an excellent image. 10</td>', 'The tones, the expression, the timelessness all add up to an excellent image. 10', '2006-04-08 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297282, 314412, 34192, '<td valign="top">One of my top three.  The border really works and I hate borders.  Toning excellent.  Tilt of background makes this shot - excellent choice.  Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'One of my top three.  The border really works and I hate borders.  Toning excellent.  Tilt of background makes this shot - excellent choice.  Absolutely beautiful.', '2006-04-08 09:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297283, 314736, 43191, '<td valign="top">You''re sending shivers down my spine.</td>', 'You''re sending shivers down my spine.', '2006-04-08 09:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297287, 314494, 43191, '<td valign="top">Normaly I don''t like shots of toys but this somehow works.</td>', 'Normaly I don''t like shots of toys but this somehow works.', '2006-04-08 09:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297288, 314515, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this and I don''t like it at the same time.  Not sure why.  This does have a great sense of depth - just enough texture in the grass, perfect amount of texture in the trees.  Maybe the foreboding nature of the sky in all its blackness is throwing me.  Toning is excellently done. I think for me there is a lack of a sense of balance.  Not sure how that could be changed or if it should be changed.  Being uncomfortable is good. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I like this and I don''t like it at the same time.  Not sure why.  This does have a great sense of depth - just enough texture in the grass, perfect amount of texture in the trees.  Maybe the foreboding nature of the sky in all its blackness is throwing me.  Toning is excellently done. I think for me there is a lack of a sense of balance.  Not sure how that could be changed or if it should be changed.  Being uncomfortable is good. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 09:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297289, 314508, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop action.  Great toning. A little hot but that''s understandable.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent stop action.  Great toning. A little hot but that''s understandable.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297290, 314905, 43191, '<td valign="top">Cute photo although it seems pixilated.</td>', 'Cute photo although it seems pixilated.', '2006-04-08 09:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297291, 314829, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the trees.  A little over-saturated for my tastes but very well seen.  Like the depth. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the texture of the trees.  A little over-saturated for my tastes but very well seen.  Like the depth. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 09:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297295, 314861, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  So much and so little.  Haunting.  Composition, toning, focus, DOF perfect for the image.  Hope it does well but you never know - its not bright and shiny. 10 - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this image.  So much and so little.  Haunting.  Composition, toning, focus, DOF perfect for the image.  Hope it does well but you never know - its not bright and shiny. 10 - good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-08 09:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297296, 314972, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty, simple, straight-forward.  Rendered well.</td>', 'Pretty, simple, straight-forward.  Rendered well.', '2006-04-08 10:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297297, 314448, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very pretty with excellent composition.  Postcard type - would have loved a person in the chair. 8 good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very pretty with excellent composition.  Postcard type - would have loved a person in the chair. 8 good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297299, 314440, 43191, '<td valign="top">And simply lovely.......</td>', 'And simply lovely.......', '2006-04-08 10:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297300, 314489, 34192, '<td valign="top">Not sure I know what overground is but I love the toning and rendering.  Love that one is looking at the viewer.  The white spot in the middle bothers me as it is distracting (toned down or cloned out maybe?)  But I like everything else about the image. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Not sure I know what overground is but I love the toning and rendering.  Love that one is looking at the viewer.  The white spot in the middle bothers me as it is distracting (toned down or cloned out maybe?)  But I like everything else about the image. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297302, 315028, 43191, '<td valign="top">Aww what a cute baby :)</td>', 'Aww what a cute baby :)', '2006-04-08 10:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297305, 314437, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenic.  Like the inclusion of the people.  The bottom 1/4 could be cropped out with no loss to image - it doesn''t add and removing it would pull the horizon lower and add significance to the people.  Toning/colors excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Pretty scenic.  Like the inclusion of the people.  The bottom 1/4 could be cropped out with no loss to image - it doesn''t add and removing it would pull the horizon lower and add significance to the people.  Toning/colors excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297306, 314637, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like this.  Wish her foot wasn''t cut off.  Fascinating POV.  DOF good.</td>', 'Like this.  Wish her foot wasn''t cut off.  Fascinating POV.  DOF good.', '2006-04-08 10:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297311, 314628, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Something ultimately cool about this image.  I feel like a grasshopper.  Colors excellent. DOF, POV work very well. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow.  Something ultimately cool about this image.  I feel like a grasshopper.  Colors excellent. DOF, POV work very well. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297317, 314613, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very surreal.  Very pretty.  Well, pretty isn''t the best word...  Love the framing.  Love the texture and detail.  Many would have cropped on the left but I believe that would have been a mistake.  Gives us just enough of the ''real world'' to make the ''other world'' more fantastical.  I''m a sucker for doorways and windows.  Metaphors and all that... :) 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very surreal.  Very pretty.  Well, pretty isn''t the best word...  Love the framing.  Love the texture and detail.  Many would have cropped on the left but I believe that would have been a mistake.  Gives us just enough of the ''real world'' to make the ''other world'' more fantastical.  I''m a sucker for doorways and windows.  Metaphors and all that... :) 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297322, 314440, 34192, '<td valign="top">The dark lightpost makes this image.  Standing a little further left would have strengthened the dichotomy.  But that''s not here or there.  Like the composition, the tones/colors, the crop.  All well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The dark lightpost makes this image.  Standing a little further left would have strengthened the dichotomy.  But that''s not here or there.  Like the composition, the tones/colors, the crop.  All well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297325, 315029, 34192, '<td valign="top">This shot is made by its POV.  You''ve rendered the people well and the DOF works well.  I love the way its framed - the top and the sides enclose the image perfectly.  Even like the cut off head at the bottom - lets me know there is more to see.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This shot is made by its POV.  You''ve rendered the people well and the DOF works well.  I love the way its framed - the top and the sides enclose the image perfectly.  Even like the cut off head at the bottom - lets me know there is more to see.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297329, 314758, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the textures and the tone.  Composition very well done.  A little over-edited for my tastes - his face doesn''t look real, but this will score well at DPC. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the textures and the tone.  Composition very well done.  A little over-edited for my tastes - his face doesn''t look real, but this will score well at DPC. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297337, 314937, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the movement and the flow of the figure.  Wish the background wasn''t so harsh - softer maybe, more like the figure.  Editing choice - we all make them the way we like them. CAptured well - 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the movement and the flow of the figure.  Wish the background wasn''t so harsh - softer maybe, more like the figure.  Editing choice - we all make them the way we like them. CAptured well - 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297340, 314477, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent POV, DOF, composition, rendering of colors and tones.  The expression of your dog is priceless.  He looks more upset that its a Yankees hat than anything else. ;) 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent POV, DOF, composition, rendering of colors and tones.  The expression of your dog is priceless.  He looks more upset that its a Yankees hat than anything else. ;) 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297350, 314973, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the balance of this image.  Outside the challenge, I would edit out the bush into blackness like area behind the wall.  Its a bit oversharpened for me - I see artifacts here and there, but it could look completely different in print.  Composition well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love the balance of this image.  Outside the challenge, I would edit out the bush into blackness like area behind the wall.  Its a bit oversharpened for me - I see artifacts here and there, but it could look completely different in print.  Composition well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-08 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297418, 314436, 35602, '<td valign="top">For some reason I really like this one.  It creates a swirl pattern when you look at the rocks, which only happens because of the top one.  Your eye just naturally flows downward.  This illusion could really be used to your advantage by using the stones as a beginning to lead the eye to another subject.  Shadows may be a little strong on the bottom but otherwise a very pleasing composition.  8</td>', 'For some reason I really like this one.  It creates a swirl pattern when you look at the rocks, which only happens because of the top one.  Your eye just naturally flows downward.  This illusion could really be used to your advantage by using the stones as a beginning to lead the eye to another subject.  Shadows may be a little strong on the bottom but otherwise a very pleasing composition.  8', '2006-04-08 11:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297423, 314739, 35602, '<td valign="top">As a sunset shot, the colors are marvelous, but the tree in the corner is placed wrong.  I have found with sunset shots that if the sky is not really dramatic, something else needs to be placed for the eye to look at.  The tree is too far to the right to peak proper interest.</td>', 'As a sunset shot, the colors are marvelous, but the tree in the corner is placed wrong.  I have found with sunset shots that if the sky is not really dramatic, something else needs to be placed for the eye to look at.  The tree is too far to the right to peak proper interest.', '2006-04-08 11:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297425, 315053, 35602, '<td valign="top">Liked the composition except for the tree in the foreground.  It seems to upset the balance of this shot.  I know you can''t remove the tree so I won''t mark down dramatically.  The cliffs are wonderfully textured and colorful and the cactus forms a nice framing.</td>', 'Liked the composition except for the tree in the foreground.  It seems to upset the balance of this shot.  I know you can''t remove the tree so I won''t mark down dramatically.  The cliffs are wonderfully textured and colorful and the cactus forms a nice framing.', '2006-04-08 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297427, 314820, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  The duotone treatment really works well, and I thought the glow treatment also added to the age of the photo.  Great job.  10</td>', 'Love this shot.  The duotone treatment really works well, and I thought the glow treatment also added to the age of the photo.  Great job.  10', '2006-04-08 11:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297428, 315047, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needs more crisp focus.</td>', 'Needs more crisp focus.', '2006-04-08 11:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
