(2297877, 314682, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well done abstract. Technically very good and the lighting on the right side adds considerably to the balance of the composition. I might have cropped a bit more off the left side. That, by no means, detracts from the overall high quality of this entry.</td>', 'Well done abstract. Technically very good and the lighting on the right side adds considerably to the balance of the composition. I might have cropped a bit more off the left side. That, by no means, detracts from the overall high quality of this entry.', '2006-04-08 16:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297878, 314707, 5792, '<td valign="top">Intersting colors, good composition and excellent sharpness and post processing. This will be a top finisher.</td>', 'Intersting colors, good composition and excellent sharpness and post processing. This will be a top finisher.', '2006-04-08 16:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297883, 314477, 5792, '<td valign="top">You don''t have to be an animal lover to appreciate the exceptional capture and quality of this image. Beautifully captured. If the DOF were just a little deeper you could have got the nose in a little sharper focus. This will be one of the highest placing images in the challenge.</td>', 'You don''t have to be an animal lover to appreciate the exceptional capture and quality of this image. Beautifully captured. If the DOF were just a little deeper you could have got the nose in a little sharper focus. This will be one of the highest placing images in the challenge.', '2006-04-08 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297889, 314805, 5792, '<td valign="top">The creativity of photographers here never ceases to amaze me. What an fantastic and provocative image. You composition and framing are perfect. The only criticism is the focus in the lower foreground and slight motling of your model''s legs, but that could be adjusted if you wanted to. Kudos to you for a great image.</td>', 'The creativity of photographers here never ceases to amaze me. What an fantastic and provocative image. You composition and framing are perfect. The only criticism is the focus in the lower foreground and slight motling of your model''s legs, but that could be adjusted if you wanted to. Kudos to you for a great image.', '2006-04-08 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297890, 314902, 39664, '<td valign="top">tons of digital noise.</td>', 'tons of digital noise.', '2006-04-08 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297891, 314884, 5792, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t that be Major Tom? Really like this image.</td>', 'Shouldn''t that be Major Tom? Really like this image.', '2006-04-08 16:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297892, 314438, 5792, '<td valign="top">The image is exceptionally well done in every way. This will finish very high in voting.</td>', 'The image is exceptionally well done in every way. This will finish very high in voting.', '2006-04-08 16:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297901, 314600, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional quality and tonality. Technical quality is fantastic and the decision having the center brightened works well in this situation. Great job. The boder style does not add greatly to the composition for DPC challenges but is perfect for an image destined for the web. High scoring image, for sure.</td>', 'Exceptional quality and tonality. Technical quality is fantastic and the decision having the center brightened works well in this situation. Great job. The boder style does not add greatly to the composition for DPC challenges but is perfect for an image destined for the web. High scoring image, for sure.', '2006-04-08 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297911, 314479, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very, very interesting composition. You give the viewer much to think about. Is this the groom? Is it a spurned suitor mourning his loss? It this someone who harbored a deep yet secretly held love for the bride?<br/> <br/>Composition and oddly off-centered perspective are very nice. B&amp;W is perfect mood for this image. Unsure if the smooth post-processing of it adds or detracts from the overall composition. Perhaps you wanted to give it an antiseptic look. This image would be just as powerful without it.</td>', 'Very, very interesting composition. You give the viewer much to think about. Is this the groom? Is it a spurned suitor mourning his loss? It this someone who harbored a deep yet secretly held love for the bride? Composition and oddly off-centered perspective are very nice. B&W is perfect mood for this image. Unsure if the smooth post-processing of it adds or detracts from the overall composition. Perhaps you wanted to give it an antiseptic look. This image would be just as powerful without it.', '2006-04-08 17:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297913, 314893, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape! my only criticism is the blown out sky ... and I would also crop out the branches on the left I don''t feel that they are needed.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape! my only criticism is the blown out sky ... and I would also crop out the branches on the left I don''t feel that they are needed.', '2006-04-08 17:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297914, 314539, 5792, '<td valign="top">Powerful and evocative image. Color and "dark" mood work very well. Great job!</td>', 'Powerful and evocative image. Color and "dark" mood work very well. Great job!', '2006-04-08 17:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297915, 314448, 18191, '<td valign="top">hehe, know who this is :-D<br/> <br/>great shot, again!</td>', 'hehe, know who this is :-D great shot, again!', '2006-04-08 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297920, 314497, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of those pictures you never quite know what to react to. The stark minimalism of the people against the towering clouds makes for a great composition. You did a very good job in post processing bringing that out. You pulled as much out this image as possible.</td>', 'One of those pictures you never quite know what to react to. The stark minimalism of the people against the towering clouds makes for a great composition. You did a very good job in post processing bringing that out. You pulled as much out this image as possible.', '2006-04-08 17:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297925, 314479, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white and perspective -- one of my favs of this challenge. My only criticism is that the background seems a little bit overly edited, but beyong that I like it!</td>', 'Beautiful black and white and perspective -- one of my favs of this challenge. My only criticism is that the background seems a little bit overly edited, but beyong that I like it!', '2006-04-08 17:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
