(2297932, 314426, 5792, '<td valign="top">You did a terrific job creating the "I can be naughty and you''ll love it" look. May I have an introduction? LOL!!<br/> <br/>Well posed and captured. Sharpened just right. Good post processing. The only suggestion would be to clone out the wrinkles on the right side backdrop and fix the two big hot spots on your model''s dress.</td>', 'You did a terrific job creating the "I can be naughty and you''ll love it" look. May I have an introduction? LOL!! Well posed and captured. Sharpened just right. Good post processing. The only suggestion would be to clone out the wrinkles on the right side backdrop and fix the two big hot spots on your model''s dress.', '2006-04-08 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297940, 314709, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky!</td>', 'Beautiful sky!', '2006-04-08 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
