(2297944, 314430, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. Your model''s dress matching the back wall is especially nice, as is the shadowed reflection off the upper wall that you smartly saw fit to include in the composition. It has a very casual, continental feel to it. Very well done.</td>', 'A very nice image. Your model''s dress matching the back wall is especially nice, as is the shadowed reflection off the upper wall that you smartly saw fit to include in the composition. It has a very casual, continental feel to it. Very well done.', '2006-04-08 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297945, 314493, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Wonderful tones and warmth here --- great job</td>', 'Beautiful! Wonderful tones and warmth here --- great job', '2006-04-08 17:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297954, 314628, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional flora composition because of your underside perspective and high quality post processing. The greenery is a little oversmoothed in places but the color post processing of the poppy flowers is beautifully done and is what makes this image great.</td>', 'Exceptional flora composition because of your underside perspective and high quality post processing. The greenery is a little oversmoothed in places but the color post processing of the poppy flowers is beautifully done and is what makes this image great.', '2006-04-08 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297957, 314758, 18191, '<td valign="top">I envy your editing skills... truly!<br/> <br/>Wowza I lurve it!</td>', 'I envy your editing skills... truly! Wowza I lurve it!', '2006-04-08 17:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297978, 314554, 5792, '<td valign="top">Only good photographers can see and capture things like this. Very well concieved and executed. This is a very nice shot. A suggestion to try is to set a black point and set a white point. That will give you a stronger black to the background and a more robust white. I think you''ll find that it will have better contrast yet still maintain its beautiful tonality.</td>', 'Only good photographers can see and capture things like this. Very well concieved and executed. This is a very nice shot. A suggestion to try is to set a black point and set a white point. That will give you a stronger black to the background and a more robust white. I think you''ll find that it will have better contrast yet still maintain its beautiful tonality.', '2006-04-08 17:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297980, 314448, 5792, '<td valign="top">You captured the feel of the south seas very well. The only bad thing about this picture is that I was not there.</td>', 'You captured the feel of the south seas very well. The only bad thing about this picture is that I was not there.', '2006-04-08 17:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
