(2298170, 314628, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Up from 8.  Very nice.  Slight variations in the framing (more vertical/narrow) and cropping (especially the sky left of center at the top) <i>may</i> make this even better <i>(or just ''another'' good shot/photograph)</i>, in my opinion.  Good depth of field.</td>', '9 - Up from 8.  Very nice.  Slight variations in the framing (more vertical/narrow) and cropping (especially the sky left of center at the top) may make this even better (or just ''another'' good shot/photograph), in my opinion.  Good depth of field.', '2006-04-08 20:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298177, 314884, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Difficult, but an adjustment of the perspective ''somehow'', trying to get the lines a little more balanced (horizon, fencing, satellite dishes) may have given this a bit more of an ''edge'' and <i>may</i> have made this even better in my opinion.  Depends what you had to work with too, of course.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Difficult, but an adjustment of the perspective ''somehow'', trying to get the lines a little more balanced (horizon, fencing, satellite dishes) may have given this a bit more of an ''edge'' and may have made this even better in my opinion.  Depends what you had to work with too, of course.', '2006-04-08 20:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298183, 314600, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice setup and capture (or acting (especially of the ''blonde'')).  Keep wanting to see that ear ''pointed'', but perhaps you cloned it out under advanced editing <i>(kidding)</i>.</td>', '8 - Nice setup and capture (or acting (especially of the ''blonde'')).  Keep wanting to see that ear ''pointed'', but perhaps you cloned it out under advanced editing (kidding).', '2006-04-08 20:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298192, 314631, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Sure this size doesn''t do it justice.  Difficult (again re this size) but even more horizontal (tighter at the top) and, depending what you had to work with of course, a little more to the left and right incorporated - bringing in much more ''breadth'', make this even better in my opinion.  Just noticed the bridle on the left ''runner'' - gives it a slightly different ''feel'' overall, not better or worse, just ''different'' - in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Sure this size doesn''t do it justice.  Difficult (again re this size) but even more horizontal (tighter at the top) and, depending what you had to work with of course, a little more to the left and right incorporated - bringing in much more ''breadth'', make this even better in my opinion.  Just noticed the bridle on the left ''runner'' - gives it a slightly different ''feel'' overall, not better or worse, just ''different'' - in my opinion.', '2006-04-08 20:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298197, 314725, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Up from 8.  Very good composition and framing.  Like the capture of the ''sensitivity strands'' at work.  Good coloring.  The only major thing in my opinion that could make this even better is the focal depth, but: a) very difficult and b) 4 years ago = a bit of a moot point.  Nice shot.</td>', '9 - Up from 8.  Very good composition and framing.  Like the capture of the ''sensitivity strands'' at work.  Good coloring.  The only major thing in my opinion that could make this even better is the focal depth, but: a) very difficult and b) 4 years ago = a bit of a moot point.  Nice shot.', '2006-04-08 20:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298199, 314479, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Recall the discussions around the relative Challenge.  Always saw this as more of a ''too early''.  ''Works'' as too late as well, but just looks and ''feels'' like ''too early'', in my opinion.  More finely tuned crop at the bottom make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Recall the discussions around the relative Challenge.  Always saw this as more of a ''too early''.  ''Works'' as too late as well, but just looks and ''feels'' like ''too early'', in my opinion.  More finely tuned crop at the bottom make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-08 20:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298201, 314492, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice portrait.  Good clarity, especially in the eye.  Skin &amp; hair texture is good, toning works well.  Good composition.</td>', '8 - Nice portrait.  Good clarity, especially in the eye.  Skin & hair texture is good, toning works well.  Good composition.', '2006-04-08 20:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298207, 314480, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Tweaking of the colors and ''rays'' (somehow) and a more finely tuned crop, especially at the top, may have made this even better, in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Tweaking of the colors and ''rays'' (somehow) and a more finely tuned crop, especially at the top, may have made this even better, in my opinion.', '2006-04-08 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298214, 314448, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Nice colors and sky/cloud capture.  Perhaps a few ''issues'' here and there, mainly in the palm, but fairly minor - in my opinion.  Nice shot and scene.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Nice colors and sky/cloud capture.  Perhaps a few ''issues'' here and there, mainly in the palm, but fairly minor - in my opinion.  Nice shot and scene.', '2006-04-08 20:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298219, 314674, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice, like the simplicity.  Maybe a slight tweaking of the colors (although not sure on that) and <i>slightest</i> nudge rotate, may have made this even better, in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Nice, like the simplicity.  Maybe a slight tweaking of the colors (although not sure on that) and slightest nudge rotate, may have made this even better, in my opinion.', '2006-04-08 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298221, 314650, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice composition and colors.  A fraction more detail in the lit ''land'' area (looks like you''ve tried), may have given this a little extra in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Nice composition and colors.  A fraction more detail in the lit ''land'' area (looks like you''ve tried), may have given this a little extra in my opinion.', '2006-04-08 20:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
