(2298797, 314910, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by emayner:</b></div><hr/><i> A nice combination of seashore and clouds in the distance. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks -- I <i>almost</i> tried to burn in the very far shoreline as it crosses the horizon, but I couldn''t get a natural look.<br/> <br/>Here''s the original -- I''m especially happy that people think the colors are good, as color-correction is one of the things I have the most trouble with.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=318536" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/318536.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/318536.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/318536.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by emayner: A nice combination of seashore and clouds in the distance.  Thanks -- I almost tried to burn in the very far shoreline as it crosses the horizon, but I couldn''t get a natural look. Here''s the original -- I''m especially happy that people think the colors are good, as color-correction is one of the things I have the most trouble with. ', '2006-04-09 02:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
