(2298993, 314480, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ltsimring:</b></div><hr/><i> nice image, Rikki, but what about "adding a major element" clause?! It''s got to be pretty major if the title is "Rays of Light"... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There were special Advance Editing rules in this one which basically said there were no rules except you couldn''t splice multiple images together.</td>', 'Originally posted by ltsimring: nice image, Rikki, but what about "adding a major element" clause?! It''s got to be pretty major if the title is "Rays of Light"...   There were special Advance Editing rules in this one which basically said there were no rules except you couldn''t splice multiple images together.', '2006-04-09 07:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
