(2299164, 314430, 52713, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the constructive comments. This is my first DPC entry. <br/> <br/>This is a candid shot of my wife in a real dressing room in a dress shop in San Miguel, Mexico. I saw the shadow on the wall and the way the dress and wall paint interplayed. The light was so low that I had to rest the camera (Nikon Coolpix 5000) on the counter top. I removed the counter and a tissue box. From reading the editing rules I thought that level of editing would be OK. I just submitted the original at DPC''s request. Hopefully my first entry won''t be DQ''d ;-)<br/> <br/>I was hoping for a higher score, but after reading the forums a bit, I guess I should be content with a 6+. 2 Favorites! I am flattered.<br/> <br/>I see some amazing work out there as browse through the images. Hopefully I can keep up. I have an entry in Textures III that is doing about as well as this one.</td>', 'Thanks for all the constructive comments. This is my first DPC entry.  This is a candid shot of my wife in a real dressing room in a dress shop in San Miguel, Mexico. I saw the shadow on the wall and the way the dress and wall paint interplayed. The light was so low that I had to rest the camera (Nikon Coolpix 5000) on the counter top. I removed the counter and a tissue box. From reading the editing rules I thought that level of editing would be OK. I just submitted the original at DPC''s request. Hopefully my first entry won''t be DQ''d ;-) I was hoping for a higher score, but after reading the forums a bit, I guess I should be content with a 6+. 2 Favorites! I am flattered. I see some amazing work out there as browse through the images. Hopefully I can keep up. I have an entry in Textures III that is doing about as well as this one.', '2006-04-09 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2299170, 314628, 52713, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 9. It was the only 9 I gave out. Should have medaled.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 9. It was the only 9 I gave out. Should have medaled.', '2006-04-09 10:50:27.000000', NULL, 0),
