(2299587, 314600, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>"Fairies" is an excellent addition to the Best of 2002 challenge.  This was a tough challenge since many of us were in such different places four years ago.<br/> <br/>It is very interesting to think it was that cold in this shot, I would not have never guessed.  I really like the glow from between there heads enhancing the wings.  Wonderful choice of black and white.  The glow gives the girls such a nice look. I think the focus being the in the center is nice and gives a soft flow to the outside edges.  The composition is lovely, I don''t feel like anything is missing from this piece.  Even though the piece is somewhat unreal it looks and feels very natural.  This was a great piece and I am so glad that you choose to enter it.    <br/> <br/>Congratulations on the top thirty it was very well deserved.</td>', '*Critique Club* "Fairies" is an excellent addition to the Best of 2002 challenge.  This was a tough challenge since many of us were in such different places four years ago. It is very interesting to think it was that cold in this shot, I would not have never guessed.  I really like the glow from between there heads enhancing the wings.  Wonderful choice of black and white.  The glow gives the girls such a nice look. I think the focus being the in the center is nice and gives a soft flow to the outside edges.  The composition is lovely, I don''t feel like anything is missing from this piece.  Even though the piece is somewhat unreal it looks and feels very natural.  This was a great piece and I am so glad that you choose to enter it.     Congratulations on the top thirty it was very well deserved.', '2006-04-09 17:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2299606, 314493, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place, congratulations! Well deserved ribbon</td>', 'Beautiful place, congratulations! Well deserved ribbon', '2006-04-09 17:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
