(2300339, 314973, 56053, '<td valign="top">wow, at Vassar!  Now I''m trying to figure out where on campus that is.  i''m amazed at how the end of the wall fades; because i can''t see where the top of the wall ends, it appears to almost lead into a vanishing point!  i think it would be super interesting if the left side of the wall was cropped so that we couldn''t see the ground.  then, the wall might appear to be much larger and more massive than it is!  either way, i really like it.  reminds me of the yellow brick road!</td>', 'wow, at Vassar!  Now I''m trying to figure out where on campus that is.  i''m amazed at how the end of the wall fades; because i can''t see where the top of the wall ends, it appears to almost lead into a vanishing point!  i think it would be super interesting if the left side of the wall was cropped so that we couldn''t see the ground.  then, the wall might appear to be much larger and more massive than it is!  either way, i really like it.  reminds me of the yellow brick road!', '2006-04-10 00:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
