(2357249, 314972, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit but almost wish you''d included more of the background.  It looks like there are dark, richly colored leaves behind this new green one, and more of that would have made a wonderful contrast.</td>', 'I like this quite a bit but almost wish you''d included more of the background.  It looks like there are dark, richly colored leaves behind this new green one, and more of that would have made a wonderful contrast.', '2006-04-29 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2357459, 314972, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like the sage green color of the leaf and the spots of water.  Such a lovely close up. Kind of dreamy against the dark background.</td>', 'Beautiful. I like the sage green color of the leaf and the spots of water.  Such a lovely close up. Kind of dreamy against the dark background.', '2006-04-29 13:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2357775, 314572, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  I think only two improvements would be in:<br/> <br/>1) Move the train just slightly to the left.  The out-of-focus bit that is  just to the top-right of the train keeps distracting me.  Don''t get me wrong, I *like* it there - the OOF parts really help focus your attention on the train.  I just think that one piece is a little too close to the train.<br/> <br/>2) The bit of red in the image lacks explanation... it''s there, but why?  Probably best to physically move it out of the frame, or else clone it out in post.</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  I think only two improvements would be in: 1) Move the train just slightly to the left.  The out-of-focus bit that is  just to the top-right of the train keeps distracting me.  Don''t get me wrong, I *like* it there - the OOF parts really help focus your attention on the train.  I just think that one piece is a little too close to the train. 2) The bit of red in the image lacks explanation... it''s there, but why?  Probably best to physically move it out of the frame, or else clone it out in post.', '2006-04-29 14:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2357996, 314572, 33181, '<td valign="top">cool image - nice angles and the train looks like one of mine :) I too have a problem with the red... i know that It is something in the scene but it looks out of place in the image</td>', 'cool image - nice angles and the train looks like one of mine :) I too have a problem with the red... i know that It is something in the scene but it looks out of place in the image', '2006-04-29 15:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2358224, 314572, 56700, '<td valign="top">Good emphases and framing techniques are used!</td>', 'Good emphases and framing techniques are used!', '2006-04-29 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2358227, 314572, 30861, '<td valign="top">Once more, MAJOR DOF issues here. IN photographinng models like this, you usally want more realism, not less. The train is admirably sharp, but the vegetation is so OOF that it is extremely unpleasing to look at. You also have a figure/ground issue at the front of the locomotive, where it is merging right into the shape behind it. Careful attention to lighting can solve this problem.</td>', 'Once more, MAJOR DOF issues here. IN photographinng models like this, you usally want more realism, not less. The train is admirably sharp, but the vegetation is so OOF that it is extremely unpleasing to look at. You also have a figure/ground issue at the front of the locomotive, where it is merging right into the shape behind it. Careful attention to lighting can solve this problem.', '2006-04-29 15:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2359580, 314572, 48058, '<td valign="top">The red doesn''t bother me... I can''t get past the out of focus bush on the left, so I never concentrate on the red. The part of the train that is in focus is good.  I agree with the comments about DOF in this one as well. <br/> <br/>I think in all 3 of your pictures you this [ ] close, but they have several weak elements that throws off the rest. <br/> <br/>Mike</td>', 'The red doesn''t bother me... I can''t get past the out of focus bush on the left, so I never concentrate on the red. The part of the train that is in focus is good.  I agree with the comments about DOF in this one as well.  I think in all 3 of your pictures you this [ ] close, but they have several weak elements that throws off the rest.  Mike', '2006-04-29 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 0),
