(3324784, 314484, 55642, '<td valign="top">I rediscovered this shot tonight while searching for photos of Kenya, and it makes me excited for the possibilities of what I might find if I get to go. A close friend is involved in a project to build a school in Kenya, and she''s working on convincing the sponsor to pay for me to go along as a photographer to document the project. No clue if it will happen, but it would be an amazing opportunity if it does. :-)</td>', 'I rediscovered this shot tonight while searching for photos of Kenya, and it makes me excited for the possibilities of what I might find if I get to go. A close friend is involved in a project to build a school in Kenya, and she''s working on convincing the sponsor to pay for me to go along as a photographer to document the project. No clue if it will happen, but it would be an amazing opportunity if it does. :-)', '2007-02-04 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 0),
